'''Fanaticism''' is a [[buff]] that grants more [[cast]] speed, less [[cost]], and increased [[area of effect]] for [[skill]]s you cast yourself. It is exclusive to the {{psl|Instruments of Zeal}} [[ascendancy passive skill]].

==Mechanics==
Fanaticism is granted to the [[character]] for 5 seconds upon reaching maximum {{stl|Fanatic Charge}}s. With {{psl|Instruments of Zeal}} allocated, the [[character]] gains 1 Fanatic Charge each second if they had [[attack|attacked]] in the past second, up to a base maximum of 3. All Fanatic Charges are lost upon reaching Maximum Fanatic Charges.

The "75% less cost" does not apply to soul cost of [[Vaal skill]]s.

The duration cannot be extended by any means like {{il|Runegraft of the Warp}}, {{stl|Shaper's Presence}} or self curse {{il|Temporal Chains}}.

{{il|Ichimonji}} increases the buff effect.

